{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-44526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51491","text":"--- name: workflows description: Use when the user asks \"how do I use graphonomous for X?\", wants end-to-end recipes, or needs guidance on common multi-step patterns like cold start, codebase exploration, debugging, or autonomous iteration. argument-hint: [cold-start|warm-resume|question|explore|debug|ralph-loop|contradictions|maintenance|end-session|teach|handoff] ---"}]},{"id":"blk-44527","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51492","text":"Graphonomous Workflows"}]},{"id":"blk-44528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51493","text":"End-to-end recipes for common tasks. Pick the workflow that matches your situation."}]},{"id":"blk-44529","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51494","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-44530","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51495","text":"Workflow type: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-44531","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51496","text":"Cold Start (empty graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51497","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51498","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"project overview\")"},{"id":"spn-51499","text":" — confirm empty 2. "},{"id":"spn-51500","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Orient on project\", \"horizon\": \"short\"})"},{"id":"spn-51501","text":" 3. Explore code/docs → "},{"id":"spn-51502","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51503","text":" for each key finding 4. Link nodes with "},{"id":"spn-51504","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51505","text":" where relationships improve retrieval 5. "},{"id":"spn-51506","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.5)"},{"id":"spn-51507","text":" 6. "},{"id":"spn-51508","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]},{"id":"blk-44533","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51509","text":"Warm Resume (existing knowledge)"}]},{"id":"blk-44534","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51510","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51511","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\", filters: {\"status\": \"active\"})"},{"id":"spn-51512","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-51513","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\", include_idle: false)"},{"id":"spn-51514","text":" 3. Pick top attention item or follow user request 4. "},{"id":"spn-51515","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<current topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-51516","text":" 5. Continue working with context, saving "},{"id":"spn-51517","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"}]},{"id":"blk-44535","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51518","text":"Answer a Question"}]},{"id":"blk-44536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51519","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51520","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<the question>\")"},{"id":"spn-51521","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-51522","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-51523","text":" 2. Check "},{"id":"spn-51524","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing"},{"id":"spn-51525","text":" — if "},{"id":"spn-51526","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-51527","text":", run "},{"id":"spn-51528","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-51529","text":" 3. Optionally "},{"id":"spn-51530","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-51531","text":" for quick act/learn/escalate pre-check 4. Answer using retrieved knowledge + current conversation 5. "},{"id":"spn-51532","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"semantic\", content: \"...\", source: \"conversation\")"},{"id":"spn-51533","text":" 6. If user confirms → "},{"id":"spn-51534","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\", causal_node_ids: [...])"}]},{"id":"blk-44537","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51535","text":"Explore a Codebase"}]},{"id":"blk-44538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51536","text":"1. Create parent goal: "},{"id":"spn-51537","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Explore <repo>\"})"},{"id":"spn-51538","text":" 2. Create sub-goals per module (3–6), each with "},{"id":"spn-51539","marks":["code"],"text":"parent_goal_id"},{"id":"spn-51540","text":" 3. For each module: explore → "},{"id":"spn-51541","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51542","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-51543","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51544","text":" 4. Use "},{"id":"spn-51545","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"traverse\", start_node_id: \"<id>\", max_depth: 2)"},{"id":"spn-51546","text":" to walk related knowledge 5. "},{"id":"spn-51547","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51548","text":" — link findings to sub-goals 6. "},{"id":"spn-51549","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51550","text":" after each module 7. "},{"id":"spn-51551","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51552","text":" on parent when all sub-goals done"}]},{"id":"blk-44539","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51553","text":"Debug a Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-44540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51554","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51555","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"prior context on <issue>\")"},{"id":"spn-51556","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-51557","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-51558","text":" 2. Isolate the issue using retrieved context 3. Test fix 4. "},{"id":"spn-51559","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"episodic\", content: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-51560","text":" 5. "},{"id":"spn-51561","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\"|\"failure\", causal_node_ids: [...])"},{"id":"spn-51562","text":" with real IDs 6. Link to goal if applicable"}]},{"id":"blk-44541","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51563","text":"Resolve Contradictions"}]},{"id":"blk-44542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51564","text":"1. Detect: "},{"id":"spn-51565","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-51566","text":" returns nodes with "},{"id":"spn-51567","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-51568","text":" edges, or "},{"id":"spn-51569","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-51570","text":" 2. Diagnose: "},{"id":"spn-51571","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-51572","text":" — examine SCCs and fault-line edges 3. Deliberate: "},{"id":"spn-51573","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"<the contradiction>\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-51574","text":" 4. Verify: "},{"id":"spn-51575","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51576","text":" again — confirm κ decreased 5. Store resolution as semantic node if not already written back"}]},{"id":"blk-44543","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51577","text":"Ralph Loop (autonomous iteration)"}]},{"id":"blk-44544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51578","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51579","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\")"},{"id":"spn-51580","text":" → pick top item 2. "},{"id":"spn-51581","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51582","text":" for that goal — save "},{"id":"spn-51583","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-51584","text":" 3. Act on it 4. "},{"id":"spn-51585","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51586","text":" with real causal IDs 5. "},{"id":"spn-51587","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51588","text":" → follow act/learn/escalate decision 6. Advance to next attention item 7. Repeat; "},{"id":"spn-51589","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-51590","text":" every 4–5 cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-44545","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51591","text":"Maintenance"}]},{"id":"blk-44546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51592","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51593","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"stats\")"},{"id":"spn-51594","text":" — check overall graph health 2. "},{"id":"spn-51595","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-51596","text":" 3. "},{"id":"spn-51597","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-51598","text":" — review all goals 4. Re-review any active goals near completion thresholds 5. Transition stale goals to "},{"id":"spn-51599","marks":["code"],"text":"suspended"},{"id":"spn-51600","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-51601","marks":["code"],"text":"abandoned"},{"id":"spn-51602","text":" with metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-44547","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51603","text":"Teach a Domain"}]},{"id":"blk-44548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51604","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-51605","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Learn <domain>\"})"},{"id":"spn-51606","text":" 2. User provides info → "},{"id":"spn-51607","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51608","text":" for each fact/procedure 3. "},{"id":"spn-51609","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51610","text":" to connect related concepts 4. "},{"id":"spn-51611","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51612","text":" — link all nodes to goal 5. Build out recursively until coverage review returns "},{"id":"spn-51613","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-44549","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51614","text":"Multi-Agent Handoff"}]},{"id":"blk-44550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51615","text":"1. Prepare state snapshot: "},{"id":"spn-51616","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-51617","text":" 2. For each active goal: "},{"id":"spn-51618","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"get_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\")"},{"id":"spn-51619","text":" 3. Include linked nodes, progress, outcomes, and coverage state 4. Recipient resumes with "},{"id":"spn-51620","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:bootstrap"},{"id":"spn-51621","text":" to load context"}]},{"id":"blk-44551","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-51622","text":"End of Session"}]},{"id":"blk-44552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-51623","text":"1. Store pending knowledge: "},{"id":"spn-51624","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51625","text":" 2. Report outcomes: "},{"id":"spn-51626","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51627","text":" 3. Update goal progress: "},{"id":"spn-51628","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-51629","text":" 4. Consolidate: "},{"id":"spn-51630","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieras5qswh573wptubbhd3qykknaygbz5krted6m3gf2ipq5eza3zp4a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}